#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""NORA Entity-Context v5.5 — hierarchical sub-intent discovery, stability, and cross-lens interaction fingerprinting.

Design constraints:
- No external/pretrained language model downloads.
- No Hugging Face/SentenceTransformer/GLiNER/BGE dependency.
- Train-only classical/statistical representations and locally learned
  distributional semantics.
- Multi-resolution semantic discovery is primary; workflow/entity-profile/relation-motif lenses remain independent structural views.
- v5.5 retains precision-calibrated entities and typed relation structure while adding full-coverage fine clustering, hierarchical sub-intent splitting, stability gating, macro families, and cross-lens fingerprints.
- No BERT/Transformer/pretrained embedding weights are downloaded or required.
"""
